# Wire events a peer sends (format: input-emulation/src/contract.rs).
# A window dragged with the left button; the peer is lost mid-drag, so the
# trace ends with the button held. Fractional motion as a libei (GNOME)
# capture sends it.
motion 0.75 0.25
motion 1.5 -0.5
button 272 1
motion 3.25 0.125
motion 4.0 0.875
motion 2.5 1.5
motion 0.375 0.0
